<title>USA: P &amp; F Industries Inc Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>P &amp; F Industries Inc Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGDALE, N.Y. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>				   1997		1996 Revenues</p>
<p>			     $ 9,217,808	 $ 9,376,425</p>
<p>Net income		     361,474	     350,293</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>primary Class A common</p>
<p>shares considered</p>
<p> outstanding		 3,474,037	   3,160,363</p>
<p>Net income per Class A</p>
<p>common share primary and</p>
<p> fully diluted		   $ .10		 $ .09</p>
<p>    NOTE:	Net income was calculated before the payment of</p>
<p>preferred dividends, earnings per share were calculated after</p>
<p>the payment of preferred dividends.  The company paid</p>
<p>preferred dividends of $21,857 in 1997 and $65,836 in 1996.</p>
</text>
